Atoms honor the production setting: rules join with no separator, loose rules
first. A file with only atoms and a production config minifies.

  $ cat > a.ml <<EOT
  > [@@@css.config [("env", "production")]]
  > [@@@css.atoms [
  >   ("_b", ["._b:hover{a:b}"], 2, 1, 1, []);
  >   ("_a", ["._a{a:b}"], 1, 0, 1, [])
  > ]]
  > [@@@css "@keyframes k{from{a:b}}"]
  > EOT

  $ styled-ppx.generate a.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  @keyframes k{from{a:b}}._a{a:b}._b:hover{a:b}
